  m_text: "WELCOME!\n\nThis section of the game is rhythm based. Space Guy's side
    is on the left, and Space Dog's is on the right! To press Space Guy's button
    press A (keyboard) or left trigger (controller). For Space Dogs's button, press
    D (keyboard) or right trigger (controller).\n\nBEWARE!\nThis level has power
    outages where you will not be able to see the buttons! There will also be bombs,
    so don't forget to deufuse them before they reach\n\t the end of the screen!\n"
